sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Worker A
    participant DB as Proxy Pool
    participant B as Worker B
    A->>DB: Acquire proxy
    DB-->>A: Proxy 7 + Token AAA
    Note over A,DB: Lease eventually expires
    B->>DB: Acquire available proxy
    DB-->>B: Proxy 7 + Token BBB
    A->>DB: Release Proxy 7 with AAA
    DB-->>A: Rejected - stale ownership
    B->>DB: Release Proxy 7 with BBB
    DB-->>B: Released